  "prefLabel": "Inst 401.02 Renewal Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 401.02 Renewal Applications.\n\n(a) The applicant shall complete and submit the “Universal Application for License Renewal” required by Plc 308.05(b)(1).\n\n(b) In addition to the information required by (a) above the applicant for license renewal shall complete and submit the “Manufactured Home Installation Addendum to the Universal Application for License Renewal” by providing the following:\n\n(1) A yes or no answer to the question “Have you successfully completed the 3 hours of continuing education course required by Inst 403 in the immediately preceding 4 years?”;\n\n(2) If the answer in (1) above, is affirmative, provide the date the continuing education course was successfully completed; and\n\n(3) The date(s) and number(s) of any previous licenses held in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #10115, eff 4-14-12; EXPIRED: 4-14-22\n\nNew. #14426, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36 (formerly Inst 301.11)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/inst100-700.html"
